Key differences to remember after migration
Capability	Auto Mode	Managed Node Groups
Pod IP assignment	EKS IPAM controller	vpc-cni daemonset (aws-node)
IP permission lives on	AmazonEKSClusterRole	AmazonEKSNodeRole
CNI policy needed	AmazonEKSNetworkingPolicy	AmazonEKS_CNI_Policy
Node scaling	Karpenter (automatic)	Cluster Autoscaler (manual setup)
EBS volumes	Built-in	aws-ebs-csi-driver addon
Load balancing	Built-in	AWS Load Balancer Controller
Node upgrades	Automatic	Manual (aws eks update-nodegroup-version)


